  "body": "Tender: Closes on Tuesday 24 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nA home of space, sunshine, spectacular sea and coastal views and an enviable seaside lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSet in one of elevated Waiake’s most sought-after positions, just one home back from the cliff, this exceptional residence captures stunning sea views, all-day sunshine, and an incredible sense of space.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless family living and entertaining, the home delivers four super-generous bedrooms, three expansive  living areas and a spectacular media room that is simply made for movie nights, relaxing and entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stunning designer gourmet kitchen, seamlessly connected to the open-plan dining and family living spaces, creating the perfect hub for entertaining and everyday family life. \r\n\r\nA separate formal lounge provides another beautiful space to relax, while the abundance of living options means there is room for everyone to spread out.\r\n\r\nDownstairs is an outstanding bonus private retreat with granny-flat-style accommodation, ideal for extended family, teenagers, long-term guests, or anyone wanting their own space.\r\n\r\nBeautifully finished in low-maintenance weatherboard, this is a home where space, light, and lifestyle come together. A large double garage, excellent off-street parking, and a level site add to the practicality, while the spectacular views and all-day sunshine provide the wow factor.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the location. Just a short stroll to the beach, with great cafés, vibrant shopping, and everything this wonderful coastal community has to offer close at hand.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a beautiful home, it is a lifestyle. A place to entertain, relax, enjoy the views and create memories for years to come.\r\n\r\nCome home to Waiake. Your seaside dream.",
